  "description": "NOW AVAILABLE!!\n\nREA McGee are delighted to present Fairview Cottages, Kildare Town to the local market. These newly refurbished houses offer 90 sq.mt, A Rated BER, underfloor heating and modern interior. \n\nAccommodation comprises of two bedrooms, main bathroom and open plan kitchen, dining and living room. Located ideally in Kildare Town, the area hosts an abundnace of amenities including local schools, childcare facilities, shops, restaurants and cafes. Kildare Village is within a 20 minute walk or 1.2km drive. Train station is within a 5 minute walk providing direct access to Dublin. Please note some cottages size and accommodation may differ.\n\nNo allocated parking.\n\nApplications through email/daft enquiries only! ",
